# JetNote project context

Read **AGENTS.md** at repo root for full layout, stack, and task placement.

## Quick facts

- Single module `:app`, package `com.hmyh.jetnote`, Kotlin + Compose Material 3.
- **Layers**: `model` (Room `@Entity`) → `data` (DB, DAO, converters, seed data) → `screen` (ViewModel + UI) → `components` (shared Compose).
- **Entry**: `NoteApplication` + `MainActivity` → `NotesApp` → `NoteViewModel` → `NoteScreen` / `NoteDetailScreen`.
- **State today**: in-memory `mutableStateListOf` in `NoteViewModel`; seed from `NoteDataSource` in `data/NoteData.kt`.
- **Room**: `Note` entity, `NoteDatabase`, `NoteDatabaseDao`, `Converters` (Date↔Long, UUID↔String). Hilt provides DB/DAO via `AppModule`. ViewModel **not wired to DAO yet**.
- **Navigation**: `selectedNote` state in `NotesApp`; no Navigation-Compose.

## Where to add code

| Kind | Package / path |
|------|----------------|
| Room entity | `model/` (`Note.kt`) |
| DB / DAO / converters | `data/` (`NoteDatabase.kt`, `NoteDatabaseDao.kt`, `Converters.kt`) |
| Fake / seed data | `data/NoteData.kt` |
| Screen + ViewModel | `screen/` |
| Reusable Compose | `components/` |
| Hilt | `di/AppModule.kt` |
| Theme | `ui/theme/` |

## Conventions

- `Note` uses `java.util.Date` + `java.util.UUID`; both need `Converters.kt` registered on `NoteDatabase`.
- `@RequiresApi(Build.VERSION_CODES.O)` on `Note` and screens using date APIs.
- New Room non-primitive fields → add `@TypeConverter` pairs in `data/Converters.kt`.
- New deps: `gradle/libs.versions.toml` version catalog.
- Minimal diffs; match existing Compose + ViewModel patterns before adding repositories or Navigation-Compose.
